		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Immortal, gargantuan blue iguana with a sting-tipped tail and head tendrils. Drags an alien madness into being.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 17, <strong>HP</strong> 73, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 rend (near) +10 (3d8) and 1 sting (near) +10 (2d10 + poison), <strong>MV</strong> far (swim), <strong>S</strong> +6, <strong>D</strong> +4, <strong>C</strong> +6, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +4, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 15</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Madness</strong>. Warps reality for all mortals within far. Each turn, WIS 18+ or DISADV.</p><p></p><p><strong>Poison</strong>. CON 18+ or 2d4 WIS damage. Insane at 0 WIS.</p><p></p><p><strong>Pure Evil</strong>. Only damaged by magic sources. Dissolves if slain, reforms in Dreamlands.</p><p></p><p><strong>Toxic Breath</strong>. On land, surrounded by near-sized cloud centered on Bokrug, 3d6 damage per turn.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
